 "lab": {
  "title": "eBGP между двумя AS",
  "text": "Две компании соединены каналом 172.16.12.0/30: R1 в AS 65001 (сеть 10.1.0.0/24), R2 в AS 65002 (сеть 10.2.0.0/24).\n\n1. Настройте eBGP-соседство между R1 и R2.\n2. Анонсируйте каждую локальную сеть командой `network … mask …`.\n3. Проверьте `show ip bgp summary`, маршрут с кодом B и связь PC1 с PC2.",
  "checks": [
   "bgp R1 1 | У R1 установлена BGP-сессия",
   "bgp R2 1 | У R2 установлена BGP-сессия",
   "route R1 10.2.0.0/24 | R1 получил сеть 10.2.0.0/24 по BGP",
   "ping PC1 10.2.0.10 | PC1 видит PC2"
  ],
  "translations": {
   "en": {
    "title": "eBGP between two autonomous systems",
    "text": "Two companies are linked by 172.16.12.0/30: R1 in AS 65001 (10.1.0.0/24), R2 in AS 65002 (10.2.0.0/24).\n\n1. Configure the eBGP neighbourship between R1 and R2.\n2. Advertise each local network with `network … mask …`.\n3. Check `show ip bgp summary`, the B route and that PC1 reaches PC2.",
    "checks": [
     "R1 has an established BGP session",
     "R2 has an established BGP session",
     "R1 learned 10.2.0.0/24 through BGP",
     "PC1 reaches PC2"
    ]
   }
  },
  "script": {
   "R1": "enable\nconfigure terminal\nrouter bgp 65001\nneighbor 172.16.12.2 remote-as 65002\nnetwork 10.1.0.0 mask 255.255.255.0\nend",
   "R2": "enable\nconfigure terminal\nrouter bgp 65002\nneighbor 172.16.12.1 remote-as 65001\nnetwork 10.2.0.0 mask 255.255.255.0\nend"
  }
 }
}